WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.501
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:04.934
You're here.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:07.467
We're in the same room.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:10.267
Well, guys, it goes without
saying, but we're living through

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:13.234
a pretty crazy time right now,
but luckily it seems like

00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:15.067
some things are getting
back to normal.

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:16.467
Watch this.

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:18.634
-A JetBlue pilot was removed
from the cockpit of a plane

00:00:18.634 --> 00:00:21.501
in Buffalo because he was
suspected of being drunk.

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:23.601
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:25.300
After he blew into
the breathalyzer,

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.467
it didn't even say a number.
It just said "new high score."

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:29.667
[ Laughter ]
Cool.

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:31.968
It's amazing -- it was the first
time a flight attendant

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:33.667
had to duct-tape a pilot
to his seat.

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:35.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.501
He was so drunk,
he refused to leave

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:38.968
unless he could go
down the slide.

00:00:38.968 --> 00:00:41.300
That's what he was saying.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.501
I guess it was pretty obvious
something was going on

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:44.901
after the pilot's
first announcement.

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:46.334
Listen to this. We got footage.

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:49.267
-[ Hiccups ]

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:55.000
[ Hiccups ]

00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:03.167
[ Can opens ]

00:01:06.467 --> 00:01:07.501
[ Hiccups ]

00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:26.801
-Interesting.
That's frightening.

00:01:26.801 --> 00:01:28.734
Guys, this is going to viral.

00:01:28.734 --> 00:01:32.033
Florida governor Ron DeSantis
saw some high school students

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:34.634
at his press conference
who were wearing masks,

00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:36.701
and he wasn't too happy
about that.

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:38.000
Watch this.

00:01:51.801 --> 00:01:54.234
-Alright, well,
it's good to be at USF.

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:56.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.901
-Wow!
-Gross.

00:01:57.901 --> 00:02:00.767
Students were like, "Somehow you
make our principal seem chill."

00:02:00.767 --> 00:02:02.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.534 --> 00:02:04.067
When their parents asked how
their day was, they're like,

00:02:04.067 --> 00:02:07.033
"I got bullied...
by the governor?"

00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:10.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:12.934
Well, guys, as Vladimir Putin
continues his invasion

00:02:12.934 --> 00:02:15.434
of Ukraine, I saw that
Netflix has paused

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:18.000
all of its
future projects from Russia.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.300
It's a little weird without them

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:20.767
in the next season of
"Queen's Gambit."

00:02:20.767 --> 00:02:22.634
They're like, "you're playing
the world's top chess master.

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:24.501
He's from Staten Island."

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:27.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.267 --> 00:02:33.100
He's the best in the world.
[ Applause ]

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.234
Then also today, IKEA announced

00:02:35.234 --> 00:02:38.501
that it's closing all 17
of its stores in Russia.

00:02:38.501 --> 00:02:40.734
IKEA said they'll do
whatever it can to throw

00:02:40.734 --> 00:02:42.901
a useless tiny wrench
into Russia's economy.

00:02:42.901 --> 00:02:45.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.367 --> 00:02:47.334
Oh, it bends. It bends.

00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:50.534
It bends? It's supposed to bend?

00:02:50.534 --> 00:02:53.067
Get this -- even Spotify has
closed its office in Russia

00:02:53.067 --> 00:02:56.367
and removed all Kremlin-backed
content from its platform.

00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:58.133
Yeah, well, we finally found out

00:02:58.133 --> 00:02:59.767
what it takes
to get kicked off Spotify.

00:02:59.767 --> 00:03:05.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:07.567
And it's not just businesses
distancing themselves.

00:03:07.567 --> 00:03:09.868
I read that
the International Cat Federation

00:03:09.868 --> 00:03:13.200
has banned Russian cats
from all competitions.

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:14.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.634 --> 00:03:16.667
I'm just going to go ahead
and say that's the biggest news

00:03:16.667 --> 00:03:18.801
that's ever come out of the
International Cat Federation.

00:03:18.801 --> 00:03:21.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.334
Meanwhile, the silence

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:24.601
from the International Dog
Federation is deafening.

00:03:24.601 --> 00:03:31.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.434
Wouldn't it be amazing if this
is what finally breaks Putin?

00:03:33.434 --> 00:03:34.667
He's like, "Enough is enough.

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:36.467
I draw the line
at cat competition.

00:03:36.467 --> 00:03:41.067
They work all their lives to
compete, some almost nine lives.

00:03:41.067 --> 00:03:43.968
And look at this."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.968 --> 00:03:45.801
Some entertainment news --
I saw that

00:03:45.801 --> 00:03:48.267
"So You Think You Can Dance"
is returning to TV

00:03:48.267 --> 00:03:50.000
after a three-year hiatus.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.234
A lot of people are excited.

00:03:51.234 --> 00:03:53.300
Here, check out this promo
they just released.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:56.334
-Maybe you thought "So You Think
You Can Dance" was in the can.

00:03:56.334 --> 00:04:00.167
Well, think again because we
think you can dance,

00:04:00.167 --> 00:04:02.567
so "So You Think You Can Dance"
is back.

00:04:02.567 --> 00:04:03.801
So it's time you think

00:04:03.801 --> 00:04:05.868
"So You Think You Can Dance"
is back too.

00:04:05.868 --> 00:04:09.501
So you and we can all dance the
can-can kinda so-so

00:04:09.501 --> 00:04:11.334
On "So you think you can dance

00:04:11.334 --> 00:04:13.334
can dance dance
think so dance can.

00:04:13.334 --> 00:04:15.934
You think?"
"So You Think You Can Dance."

00:04:15.934 --> 00:04:17.834
Does anybody else smell
burnt toast?

00:04:17.834 --> 00:04:22.834
-I mean, the guy's losing it.
He shouldn't do voiceover.

00:04:22.834 --> 00:04:24.501
Some more TV news --

00:04:24.501 --> 00:04:27.934
Next year HBO Max will begin
streaming U.S. soccer matches.

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:29.634
[ Audience cheers ]

00:04:29.634 --> 00:04:30.801
Of course, since it's HBO,

00:04:30.801 --> 00:04:32.601
every match will have
full frontal nudity.

00:04:32.601 --> 00:04:34.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:34.968 --> 00:04:37.734
And finally, a man was recently
pulled over by police,

00:04:37.734 --> 00:04:39.467
and he had a very creative
excuse to try

00:04:39.467 --> 00:04:41.300
to get out of a ticket.
Watch this.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:44.434
-Florida man really wanted out
of a traffic stop,

00:04:44.434 --> 00:04:47.033
but deputies in Flagler County
were not expecting

00:04:47.033 --> 00:04:48.834
this excuse for speeding.

00:04:48.834 --> 00:04:50.534
He blamed it on Vladimir Putin,

00:04:50.534 --> 00:04:53.934
saying he was speeding home
because of a nuclear war.

00:04:53.934 --> 00:04:57.067
[ Laughter ]

00:04:57.067 --> 00:04:58.734
-Don't worry.
Despite the arrest,

00:04:58.734 --> 00:05:01.634
the man was able to keep his job
as a pilot for JetBlue.

